    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like nothing helps. every time i think i've finally turned a corner, i just end up right back at the bottom. it’s like i’m broken or something. like there’s no version of me that actually works. it's just constant struggle and i'm so tired of fighting it.",
