    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's exhausting to keep fighting a battle that feels impossible to win, and you are absolutely not broken—you're just tired of the fight. The idea that you'll never find a version of yourself that \"works\" is a heavy lie you're telling yourself, but it's a very convincing one when you're this worn out. Sometimes, the most effective way to stop the struggle is to stop trying to fix it all at once.",
      "source": "target",
